@startuml
title Retained FLT Candidate Matcher — Preparation and Exact Dispatch

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

rectangle "Injection preparation\n`rholang-runtime`" as Prep #DBEAFE {
  component "normalized `Par`\ncanonical stack-safe walk" as Program #BFDBFE
  component "eligible `BindPattern`s\nsort + deduplicate" as Patterns #BFDBFE
  component "one batch compile / extend" as Batch #93C5FD
}

rectangle "Retained matcher state" as Retained #DCFCE7 {
  component "Dovetail `SetAutomaton`\nprefix-stable `StateId`s" as Automaton #BBF7D0
  component "append-only flat PDA\nserialized new suffix only" as Pda #86EFAC
  component "exact pattern → entry map" as Lookup #BBF7D0
}

rectangle "RSpace candidate boundary" as Candidate #FEF3C7 {
  component "`Match::get(pattern, data)`" as Get #FDE68A
  component "strict FLT eligibility" as Eligible #FDE68A
  component "four-word frames +\nflat capture arena" as Execute #FCD34D
}

rectangle "Existing f1 matcher" as Existing #FCE7F3 {
  component "spatial `Matcher::get`\noriginal inputs, verbatim" as Spatial #FBCFE8
}

rectangle "Result" as Result #EDE9FE {
  component "exact ordered captures\nor proven miss" as Answer #DDD6FE
}

Program --> Patterns
Patterns --> Batch
Batch --> Automaton : intern shared states
Automaton --> Pda : `state_ids().skip(first_new)`
Patterns --> Lookup : exact entry boundary

Get --> Eligible
Eligible --> Lookup : admitted
Lookup --> Execute : root + slot map
Pda --> Execute : immutable instructions
Execute --> Answer : match / miss
Eligible --> Spatial : declined shape
Spatial --> Answer : unchanged behavior

note bottom of Retained
  No RSpace receiver or message is retained.
  The automaton and PDA are matcher-owned Rust data.
end note

legend right
|= Color |= Responsibility |
|<#DBEAFE> blue | injection-time canonical preparation |
|<#DCFCE7> green | retained interning and serialization |
|<#FEF3C7> amber | candidate-time fast path |
|<#FCE7F3> pink | strict spatial fallback |
|<#EDE9FE> violet | externally observable match result |
endlegend
@enduml
